# Every recursion of the program is a loop once idr-tail-loops has run:
# replicate's and take's too, whose self calls idr-trmc made tail calls.
# idr-tail-loops runs over the functions in a group, which dumps no module;
# idr-narrow, the next step, is the first to show its loops.
idr-narrow: constant-stack=@$idris-mlir.root
